Example
Create a timestamp using the
mktime()
function:
struct tm datetime;
time_t timestamp;

datetime.tm_year = 2023 - 1900; // Number of years since 1900
datetime.tm_mon = 12 - 1; // Number of months since January
datetime.tm_mday = 17;
datetime.tm_hour = 12;
datetime.tm_min = 30;
datetime.tm_sec = 1;
// Daylight Savings must be specified
